    "解析": "**答案：** $\\dfrac{8}{3}$   **解析：** 由 $f(2) - \\dfrac{1}{2}f(-2) = 4$，$f(-2) - \\dfrac{1}{2}f(2) = -4$，得 $2f(2) - f(-2) = 8$，$f(-2) - \\dfrac{1}{2}f(2) = -4$，相加得 $\\dfrac{3}{2}f(2) = 4$，故 $f(2) = \\dfrac{8}{3}$．",
